  <name>The Rolling Mill V</name>
  <description>1 effort block peaking at 97% in 120 minutes. Ride the fine line between sustainable and unsustainable — that is threshold. This strengthens your aerobic ceiling while training you to ride just below it. The effort sits right at the boundary of what you can sustain.</description>
